      "fine_trace_step": 7,
      "description": "First witness-specific invariant violation. `compact_neutrals()` merges adjacent neutral runs solely on resolved level/type and bracket state, without requiring equal `RL_ISOLATE_LEVEL`. On this witness it merges `FSI` (outer isolate chain) with the following `ON` run (inner isolate chain), corrupting the isolate-side links that later turn a subsequent compaction merge into a use-after-free write."
    },
